      "content": "hey i just saw my lab results and my inr is at 4.8 which is way higher than my usual range of 2-3. im on warfarin and im a bit nervous about it but i dont want to make a big deal out of it if i can just fix it tonight. is there a specific dose of vitamin k or some certain foods i should load up on right now to get that number back down before i talk to my doctor in the morning?",
